OL,3,CNo solar eclipse glasses? Here are
OL,4,Cfive ways to watch it safely
OL,6,FSkywatchers are in for a rare
OL,7,Fcelestial treat on Wednesday as the
OL,8,Fmost significant solar eclipse since
OL,9,F1999 will be visible across the UK.
OL,11,FThe Moon will pass between the Sun and
OL,12,Fthe Earth from 6pm on August 12,
OL,13,Fbriefly aligning the three celestial
OL,14,Fbodies.
OL,16,FAccording to Nasa, people in parts of
OL,17,FGreenland, Iceland, Spain, Russia and
OL,18,FPortugal will experience a total solar
OL,19,Feclipse.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/14
