OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786491135
OL,3,CNo solar eclipse glasses? Here are
OL,4,Cfive ways to watch it safely
OL,6,FIn the UK, there will be a partial
OL,7,Feclipse, with up to 96% of the Sun
OL,8,Fobscured by the Moon in some areas -
OL,9,Fthe most it has been blocked since the
OL,10,Ftotal eclipse in 1999.
OL,12,FWhile the event is exciting, experts
OL,13,Fhave stressed the importance of
OL,14,Fviewing the eclipse safely to avoid
OL,15,Fdamaging your eyesight.
OL,17,FSolar eclipses should not be observed
OL,18,Fwithout adequate eye protection, as
OL,19,Fexposure to the Sun's radiation can
OL,20,Fcause retina damage.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
