OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786491135
OL,3,CNo solar eclipse glasses? Here are
OL,4,Cfive ways to watch it safely
OL,6,FThe safest way to view the phenomenon
OL,7,Fis with certified eclipse glasses
OL,8,Ffitted with industry safety standard
OL,9,Ffilters.
OL,11,FHowever, with many retailers selling
OL,12,Fout, the UK Health Security Agency has
OL,13,Furged people to be wary of products
OL,14,Fclaiming to offer protection without
OL,15,Fmeeting the necessary safety
OL,16,Frequirements. It also advises against
OL,17,Fusing glasses with scratched or
OL,18,Fdamaged lenses.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
