OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786491135
OL,3,CNo solar eclipse glasses? Here are
OL,4,Cfive ways to watch it safely
OL,6,FIf you were unable to grab a pair of
OL,7,Feclipse glasses, do not worry, as
OL,8,Fthere are still safe ways to enjoy the
OL,9,Fevent.
OL,11,FDavid Jones, a consultant
OL,12,Fophthalmologist at Royal Cornwall
OL,13,FHospitals Trust, has shared a range of
OL,14,Fsimple DIY viewing methods on social
OL,15,Fmedia, showing how people can watch
OL,16,Fthe eclipse safely without looking
OL,17,Fdirectly at the Sun or needing
OL,18,Fspecialist equipment.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
