OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786491135
OL,3,CNo solar eclipse glasses? Here are
OL,4,Cfive ways to watch it safely
OL,6,FDavid Jones, a consultant
OL,7,Fophthalmologist, shares his DIY tips
OL,8,Fon safely viewing the eclipse without
OL,9,Flooking directly at the Sun. Credit:
OL,10,FRoyal Cornwall Hospitals Trust
OL,12,FPinhole viewer
OL,14,FOne option is making a pinhole viewer
OL,15,Fusing two sheets of card and a pen or
OL,16,Fpencil. This lets you safely project
OL,17,Fan image of the Sun, according to the
OL,18,FUKHSA.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
