FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786491135
OL,3,CNo solar eclipse glasses? Here are
OL,4,Cfive ways to watch it safely
OL,6,FTo do this, take the pen and make a
OL,7,Fhole in the middle of a sheet of
OL,8,Fcoloured card. Stand with your back to
OL,9,Fthe Sun and hold the card up, with a
OL,10,Fwhite piece of card behind it.
OL,11,FSunlight should pass through the hole
OL,12,Fonto the second sheet, and you can
OL,13,Fwatch the eclipse appear as a
OL,14,Fprojected image.
OL,16,FColander method
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
