FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786491135
OL,3,CNo solar eclipse glasses? Here are
OL,4,Cfive ways to watch it safely
OL,6,FLooking away to protect your eyes,
OL,7,Fhold a colander up towards the Sun so
OL,8,Fthat it projects beams of light onto a
OL,9,Fsurface, such as a white piece of
OL,10,Fpaper.
OL,12,FMr Jones said this method is his
OL,13,Ffavourite, as you can make 100
OL,14,Fpictures of the Sun all at once.
OL,16,FUse a dark box
OL,18,FFor this, you will need a cardboard
OL,19,Fbox, such as a cereal box, some white
OL,20,Fpaper, a piece of foil, scissors, a
OL,21,Fpen and a glue stick or tape.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
