PN,31408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786491135
OL,3,CNo solar eclipse glasses? Here are
OL,4,Cfive ways to watch it safely
OL,6,FTake the cardboard box and stick a
OL,7,Fsection of white paper to one side.
OL,9,FOn the opposite side, poke two holes -
OL,10,Fone for viewing and the other a
OL,11,Fpinhole.
OL,13,FCover the pinhole with a piece of
OL,14,Faluminium foil. Then stand with your
OL,15,Fback to the Sun and look into the
OL,16,Fviewing hole. You should see a picture
OL,17,Fof the Sun on the white piece of paper
OL,18,Fwithin the box.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
