OL,3,CNo solar eclipse glasses? Here are
OL,4,Cfive ways to watch it safely
OL,6,FAstronomical society events
OL,8,FLocal astronomical societies across
OL,9,Fthe UK are hosting public events for
OL,10,Fpeople to watch the eclipse using
OL,11,Fspecial glasses and solar telescopes.
OL,13,FThese include the South London
OL,14,FAstronomical Society, Reading
OL,15,FAstronomical Society and the
OL,16,FAstronomical Society of Edinburgh.
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/14
