PN,31414
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786491135
OL,3,CNo solar eclipse glasses? Here are
OL,4,Cfive ways to watch it safely
OL,6,FThe next time the Moon obscures as
OL,7,Fmuch of the Sun will be in 2081, and
OL,8,Fthe next total solar eclipse in the UK
OL,9,Fwill be in 2090.
OL,11,FWhatever you do on Wednesday, don't
OL,12,Flook directly at the Sun.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/14
